        </div>

        <div class="pf-why-item">
          <h3>Modern Private Estates</h3>
          <p>The Grange off Whinberry Drive, Brookhaven, the newer developments in Northwood. Modern combi boilers, mains pressure systems, often still under manufacturer warranty. We honour warranty conditions.</p>
