          <h3>1970s Boiler and Cylinder Replacements</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">10 min response</span></div>
          <p>Some Kirkby homes still have the original 1970s heating systems. Back boilers behind gas fires. Open vented cylinders in the airing cupboard. Beyond economic repair now. We replace with modern combi or system boilers. ECO4 grants cover some households.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Flat-Gradient Drain Blockages</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">10 min response</span></div>
          <p>Kirkby sits on relatively flat ground. Drainage gradients are minimal. That means food waste, grease and debris settle faster than in steeper areas. We use high-pressure jetting and can run CCTV surveys if blockages keep recurring.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Frozen Pipe Bursts</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">10 min response</span></div>
          <p>Kirkby's older semis often have poorly insulated lofts. Cold snaps cause pipe bursts above ceilings. Damage shows up before the water's even off. We attend 24/7 and fit pipe lagging on the same visit to stop it happening again.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Knowsley Industrial Park Commercial</h3>
