          <h3>CP12 Landlord Certificates</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">10 min response</span></div>
          <p>Kirkby has a strong buy-to-let market. CP12 gas safety certificates from £80 per property. Same-day available. Combined boiler service and CP12 from £175. We batch multiple properties for landlords with several Kirkby rentals.</p>
